OL,3,GNEWSACall to stop the loss of
OL,4,Aagricultural land
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoves are under way to halt the loss of
OL,7,Fagricultural land in Guernsey.
OL,9,FDeputy Ross Le Brun said he would bring
OL,10,Fa proposal when a review of the rules
OL,11,Fgoverning the island's planning laws
OL,12,Fcame to the States to amend a rule
OL,13,Fcalled GP15, to make it more difficult
OL,14,Ffor agricultural land to be turned into
OL,15,Fdomestic gardens.
OL,17,FQuestions from Le Brun revealed that
OL,18,Fsince GP15 was introduced, 99.35
OL,19,Fvergees (40 acres) of land within the
OL,20,Fagriculture priority area have been
OL,21,Fapproved for conversion to domestic
OL,22,Fcurtilage.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
