OL,3,GNEWSACall to stop the loss of
OL,4,Aagricultural land
OL,5,
OL,6,FLe Brun said: "We need to protect land.
OL,7,FWe're sort of sleepwalking into a
OL,8,Fsituation where obviously there's
OL,9,Fglobal events that impact food supply
OL,10,Fto Guernsey."
